{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wEOuvNzLTj1795736335.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>遠東發展截至9月底止中期轉虧為盈，純利2.55億元，主要由於出售若干非核心資產產生的總收益淨額，並無分佔一間合營公司及一間聯營公司的減值虧損，以及無待售物業減值虧損，和投資物業公平值收益淨額。</p><p></p><p>期內經調整現金溢利增長1.2倍，收入則跌三成四。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:43:57.339626+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T23:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T06:57:12.892866+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T00:37:18.560501+00:00","content_hash":"901889988aff6cbeec27b2e7bbf2276e0c1e34b0c6ce2cf615d866be7ad8025d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:43:57.339626+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}